WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.520
- I'm here with Lisa Rinna

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.619
and on the line now is also
Rainn Wilson, give it up.

00:00:04.619 --> 00:00:07.120
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.680
My next guest is a two time Grammy winner

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.300
who's single Old Town Road

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.960
shattered just about
every record last year,

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:17.450
his new EP is called The
Singin' Hills Sessions Mojave,

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.400
it's out now,

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.498
give it up for Billy Ray Cyrus everybody!

00:00:20.498 --> 00:00:25.370
(clapping)
(rock music)

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.000
I like that little lick.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.589
What's up man?

00:00:28.589 --> 00:00:29.660
- I'm good, how you doing?

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.230
- I'm doing all right,
I'm doing all right.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.810
Well, when, when you were here in March

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:36.449
before the world decided to just turn,

00:00:36.449 --> 00:00:38.910
Old Town Road was 10 times platinum

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:41.280
and now it's 13 times platinum,

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:43.210
can you believe it hasn't slowed down?

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.718
People love that song.

00:00:45.718 --> 00:00:47.890
- It's it's been crazy
and, and you're right

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:50.200
referring back to the last time I saw you

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:54.200
was the last little bit of normal

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.080
- Yeah.
- that I recall.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.710
Everything after that,
I left from your couch

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:01.430
and went and did a show with Neil Diamond

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:03.970
and Sammy Hagar in Las Vegas.

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:04.803
- Wow.

00:01:04.803 --> 00:01:06.610
- And I caught a Southwest flight

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:08.930
the next morning after
that back to Nashville

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:11.570
and by the time I landed
the whole world had changed.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:15.030
So it's at this moment to be
back with you going full circle

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:17.530
and we're all starting brand new again

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:19.440
and you're right about Old Town Road.

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.960
I think that a lot of
people hear that song

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.540
and go back to 2019.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.488
I know I do, I loved 2019 and, and--

00:01:26.488 --> 00:01:27.870
- Oh my gosh.
- I know.

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:30.524
- Really any year other
than this one, but yeah.

00:01:30.524 --> 00:01:32.237
(laughing)

00:01:32.237 --> 00:01:35.550
- Yeah, this year I'm
looking forward to 2021.

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:37.860
- Hey man, your mouth to God's ear.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:41.360
Is it, is it true you got
your first iPhone this year,

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:42.859
is that a real thing?

00:01:42.859 --> 00:01:45.096
(laughing)
- Yeah.

00:01:45.096 --> 00:01:46.765
It's a bit embarrassing to bring it up,

00:01:46.765 --> 00:01:50.500
but I'd been a little like Fred Flintstone

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:54.270
and realized that my mom
was living like the Jetsons

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.220
and I go, man, I'm scared
to death of change,

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.510
but I think I really need
to step up to the plate

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:01.075
and now that I have, it's
opened up a whole new world.

00:02:01.075 --> 00:02:04.770
I write all my songs now on my iPhone,

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.150
it's quicker, it's better,

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.860
you can put it in your pro tools.

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.670
It's like, I can't believe it,

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:11.160
but I'm scared to death of change

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:13.357
and sometimes that's like that,

00:02:13.357 --> 00:02:14.690
but change is the only thing

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:16.670
I think you could really count on in life

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.690
and I should have embraced it earlier.

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:21.280
I've sent a lot of
blurry pictures out there

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.470
over the last 20 years,

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.330
I got my first Blackberry I think

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.900
while we were doing Hannah Montana,

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:28.960
I think I remember taking
a picture with Lisa.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:29.810
How you doing Lisa?

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.630
- I'm great Billy, how you doing?

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.293
It's great to see you.

00:02:33.293 --> 00:02:36.030
- You too, we had fun on
Hannah Montana, didn't we?

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:37.430
- We sure did.

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:38.560
- I love that!

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:39.660
- We sure did, I'll never forget it

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.410
and you know how much I love Miley.

